*** Begin ECU Patch
Key: 008-order-publish-package-build
Title: Order the publish package build graph
Purpose: Make the release publisher build every package after its workspace dependencies in a clean checkout.

*** Begin Context
After all three required checks passed remotely, the publish job exposed the same warm-worktree assumption in build:publish-packages. The command started Domain before Platform and built Dataset before OpenAI Reactor. This patch reuses the validated prerequisite build and orders the remaining publish packages causally.
*** End Context

